    "en": "Collect the north and east bell batteries and reach the southwest terminus within 50 turns. The conductor chases Sprout while two shuttles follow fixed tracks. Sharing a square or swapping places head-on ends the run. Bridges switch on turns 6 and 18. The east bell moves to the night stop on turn 18 if it is still there."
